      "kind": "js",
      "line": 126,
      "zh": "e^(−x²) 没有初等原函数，但全空间积分恰好等于 √π；把一维高斯视为二维旋转对称分布即可推出。有限区间的精确值借助误差函数 erf 给出。",
      "en": "e^(−x²) has no elementary antiderivative, but its integral over the whole line is exactly √π; treat the 1-D Gaussian as a 2-D rotationally symmetric distribution to derive it. Exact values on finite intervals are given with the error function erf."
    },
    {
      "file": "game.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 136,
      "zh": "e^(−x) 在正半轴上的反常积分收敛于 1，这正是指数分布归一化常数的来源。",
      "en": "The improper integral of e^(−x) over the positive half-line converges to 1, which is where the normalisation constant of the exponential distribution comes from."
    },
    {
      "file": "game.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 146,
      "zh": "sin(x)/x 在 x=0 处取极限值 1，它的全空间积分是著名的 Dirichlet 积分，答案恰好为 π。",
      "en": "sin(x)/x has limit 1 at x=0, and its integral over the whole line is the famous Dirichlet integral, exactly π."
    },
