    {
      "file": "game.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 1115,
      "zh": "倍增次数（正 6 边形起，边数逐次翻倍，误差约正比于 1/n²）",
      "en": "Doublings (starting from a hexagon, sides double each time, error roughly proportional to 1/n²)"
    },
    {
      "file": "game.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 1120,
      "zh": "拉马努金公式每多算一项，正确位数约增加 8 位：仅 2 项（k = 0、1）就给出约 15 位正确数字，这种超指数收敛来自分母中 396 的 4k 次方。",
      "en": "Each extra Ramanujan term adds about 8 correct digits: just 2 terms (k = 0, 1) give about 15 correct digits. This super-exponential convergence comes from the 4k-th power of 396 in the denominator."
    },
    {
      "file": "game.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 1122,
      "zh": "莱布尼茨级数要到第 500 项才勉强获得 3 位小数——在双对数图上它只是一条缓缓下行的直线，与几乎垂直坠落的拉马努金曲线对照，便知拉马努金的伟大。",
      "en": "The Leibniz series needs 500 terms to barely reach 3 decimals; on a log-log chart it is just a slowly sloping line, and next to the almost vertical Ramanujan curve you can see how remarkable Ramanujan's series is."
    },
    {
      "file": "game.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 1123,
      "zh": "割圆术用内接正多边形周长逼近圆周长，边数翻倍一次误差约减为四分之一；刘徽当年算到正 3072 边形得到 π ≈ 3.1416，已是公元三世纪的奇迹。",
      "en": "The polygon method approximates the circle's circumference by the perimeter of an inscribed regular polygon; each doubling of the sides cuts the error to about a quarter. Liu Hui went up to a 3072-gon and got π ≈ 3.1416, a marvel of the 3rd century."
    },
