    {
      "file": "game.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 1440,
      "zh": "Hann 窗把能量在频域展宽，却显著压低非整周期频率的泄漏旁瓣，代价是主瓣变宽、频率分辨率下降。",
      "en": "The Hann window spreads energy across frequencies but strongly suppresses leakage sidelobes for non-integer-period frequencies, at the cost of a wider main lobe and lower frequency resolution."
    },
    {
      "file": "game.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 1441,
      "zh": "矩形窗主瓣最窄、频率分辨率最高，但分量频率不落在 bin 上时旁瓣泄漏明显，可切换 Hann 窗对比。",
      "en": "The rectangular window has the narrowest main lobe and the best frequency resolution, but sidelobe leakage is clear when a component does not fall on a bin; switch to the Hann window to compare."
    },
    {
      "file": "game.js",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 1442,
      "zh": " 补零到 ",
      "en": " Zero-padding to "
